---
layout: base.njk
title: Albums
permalink: /recordings/
description: "Recordings of Frank La Rocca's music on Cappella Records and Enharmonic Records, including the Mass of the Americas and Requiem for the Forgotten."
---
<h1>Albums</h1>
<div class="albums stack">
{%- for r in recordings %}
<div class="album" id="{{ r.id }}">
  {% if r.cover %}<img src="{{ r.cover }}" alt="Album cover, {{ r.title }}" width="1200" height="1200" loading="{% if loop.first %}eager{% else %}lazy{% endif %}">{% else %}<div class="cover-blank"></div>{% endif %}
  <div>
    <h2>{{ r.title | replace(" · ", "<br>") | safe }}</h2>
    <p class="label">{{ r.label }}, {{ r.year }}</p>
    <p>{{ r.blurb }}</p>
    {% if r.tracks %}<p class="tracks">{{ r.tracks }}</p>{% endif %}
    <div class="work-links">{% include "streaming.njk" %}</div>
  </div>
</div>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
<h2 class="section-title">Also recorded</h2>
<p><em>Canti d'Innocenza</em> on the SCI label, and a cappella choral works on albums by the San Francisco Girls Chorus, Young Women's Choral Projects, Tucson Girls Chorus, the Meistersingers, Vanguard Voices, the Cardinal Singers of the University of Louisville, the Prague Radio Choir and Orchestra, and the Cathedral Choral Society.</p>
